cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Anvil, please cite the software using these metadata and record the exact version and commit used."
title: "Anvil: A portable agent runtime for ACP clients"
type: software
abstract: "Anvil is a Rust Agent Client Protocol (ACP) server providing a reusable agent engine for editors, bots, TUIs, and internal tools. It handles model routing, tool execution, permissions, sessions, context compaction, sandboxing, and MCP integration."
authors:
  - name: "Anvil contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/BrokkAi/anvil/graphs/contributors"
contact:
